{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/a269d0820734dfa98a9a9cf3cf639da8.avif?t=1764098872\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snail Mail is a competitive 2 or 4-player online card-based board game!<br>Play with your friends for free with a Friend's Pass, provided that at least one person owns the full game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.poster.avif?t=1764098872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.webm?t=1764098872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.mp4?t=1764098872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a snail and bring your snailtopian town to glory by delivering THE letter to the other end FIRST.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/7d88d23d8e6fa0211f90d67fc919affe.avif?t=1764098872\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call upon otherworldly allies by constructing a deck with thematic, powerful cards that change the course of the game</strong><br><br><br><strong> </strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/390b141d9dcdd44be5185d9a1746cb01.poster.avif?t=1764098872\" width=1170 height=634 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/390b141d9dcdd44be5185d9a1746cb01.webm?t=1764098872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/390b141d9dcdd44be5185d9a1746cb01.mp4?t=1764098872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You are not alone in this race! Your friends from other realities are ready to help you advance faster on the board, stall the enemy, or perform other moves like stealing cards from your opponents! <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/35f3b8505540c16456d3496a866f2deb.avif?t=1764098872\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no slow crawl! You need a whole lot of strategy and a <i>little </i>bit of luck to win this chaotic game. Be on your toes as you navigate through the board because one big brain move can change the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.poster.avif?t=1764098872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.webm?t=1764098872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.mp4?t=1764098872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/5bc67a8d6769017dcd5fb3aef9e02651.avif?t=1764098872\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla